  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n- ADDED: navigation (index, organization), bank products, workflows\n- ADDED: legal persons (create, get, list, rename), claims (Claims module; list, add, delete), verifications, IDV check links, decisions, manual decisions\n- ADDED: bank accounts (open, get, list, close), restrictions (freeze, block, lift), statements (request, get, download), Direct Debit mandates (list, get, cancel)\n- ADDED: Confirmation of Payee and its sandbox simulation, payees (create, get, list, deactivate), payments (create, submit, submissions), admissions, transactions\n- ADDED: events with typed payloads, webhook management, webhook verification (ES512) with Webhook.KeyCache\n- ADDED: RFC 9421 request signing through a pluggable RequestSigner (Ed25519, required in live mode)\n- ADDED: Api.sendAsync / sendRawAsync for any endpoint, Api.downloadAsync, Api.allPagesAsync for pagination\n- ADDED: DUs with Other for Griffin's closed value sets; UkAccount with validation; InvalidRequest before sending\n- ADDED: Page.Unparsed keeps unreadable list items; WebhookRejection says why a delivery failed; KeyCache keeps its keys when a refresh fails\n- ADDED: for C#: GriffinConfig.Create, Money.Gbp, RequestSigner.Create, WebhookRequest.Create, GriffinApi.AllPagesAsync / WithQuery, GetValueOrThrow(Async) with GriffinException\n- ADDED: GriffinFailure.describe; list parameters (claims, country codes, query pairs) take any sequence\n- ADDED: searches (legal persons, bank accounts, payments), account rename, webhook update, Companies House lookup\n- ADDED: card holds, pooled account membership, tell.money open banking consents, Claims.verifiedBankAccount",
